---
import site from '../../site.config'
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="Cookie policy">
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose">
    <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
    <p>This site sets no analytics cookies unless you accept them.</p>

    <h2>What we use, with your permission</h2>
    <p>
      If you click Accept, we load Microsoft Clarity. It records how visitors use the site
      (pages viewed, clicks, scrolling) so we can improve it. Clarity sets cookies such as
      <code>_clck</code> and <code>_clsk</code> and sends this usage data to Microsoft.
      See <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="noopener">Microsoft's privacy statement</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What is always stored</h2>
    <p>Your cookie choice is saved in your browser so we do not ask again. Nothing else is stored unless you accept.</p>

    <h2>Other companies' tools</h2>
    <p>A booking calendar or map on this site comes from another company and loads only when you click to open it. That company may then set its own cookies.</p>

    <h2>Changing your mind</h2>
    <p><button type="button" class="btn outline" data-cookie-settings>Open cookie settings</button></p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: {site.contact.email ? <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> : site.name}.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose { max-width: 44rem; }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: 1.5em; font-size: 1.4rem; }
</style>
